/* English source strings for the Docker plugin. The key IS the English text.

   Not in here on purpose: the three section names of the tree ("Compose Projects",
   "Standalone Containers", "Volumes"). Those are path components — they appear in the location
   bar, in a restored tab and in anything anybody scripts — so they stay English in every
   language rather than breaking every saved path the first time somebody switches locale. */

